title: '''Hides'' should be viewed as two folders, ''hidden'' and ''integrated'', under each subscribee-as-such.'
pid: 5b52063b-b8b1-4eef-9f2e-4b6c656496d1
body: |2-
  Each one absent if empty.
  I'm not sure whether the hidden-integrated distinction
    needs to be formally represented.
  But the user should see, of those atoms that a subscriber does not show,
  which are shown somewhere else in the atoms the user has.
